                    {
                        "form_id": "68f567a3-870d-441e-bfcc-a33208f7b441",
                        "entry_id": "b2d591c0-0ab3-3503-8c59-4c4f3b4a7458",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "крамо́ле"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ad4d3df9-9898-42f3-bf7a-d9472ea60d80",
                        "entry_id": "b2d591c0-0ab3-3503-8c59-4c4f3b4a7458",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "крамо́лах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4789e05-00be-30eb-82ed-d9f91d515067",
                        "entry_id": "b2d591c0-0ab3-3503-8c59-4c4f3b4a7458",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. бунт, мятеж; смута, восстание"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "364a5517-54f8-4b64-b38f-bef911348a22",
                                "sense_id": "a4789e05-00be-30eb-82ed-d9f91d515067",
                                "text": "Я люблю святую Русь не менее вас; но вы ненавидите одних поляков, а я ненавижу ещё более крамолы, междоусобие и бесполезное кровопролитие, противные господу и пагубные для нашего отечества."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "992c66a4-2ce2-300d-a14b-46d59d8e13ca",
                        "entry_id": "b2d591c0-0ab3-3503-8c59-4c4f3b4a7458",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. то, что запрещено, противозаконно, предосудительно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71d46687-9135-426a-be91-0d298c23af7a",
                                "sense_id": "992c66a4-2ce2-300d-a14b-46d59d8e13ca",
                                "text": "Тогда, в 1953 году, всё это изображалось как страшная крамола, приверженцы которой заслуживали смертной казни."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5485afd3-c949-4945-9238-8fafe35d3b70",
                                "sense_id": "992c66a4-2ce2-300d-a14b-46d59d8e13ca",
                                "text": "Здесь же даже помыслы о ней — крамола, за которую неизбежна расплата."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cfe03ba-0576-4aa8-b488-3e1176eea652",
                                "sense_id": "992c66a4-2ce2-300d-a14b-46d59d8e13ca",
                                "text": "Когда же задержки с выплатой денежного содержания снова возросли до трёх и более месяцев, группа офицеров Генерального штаба задумала невиданную крамолу — задержать на Знаменке президентский кортеж и потребовать от Верховного Главнокомандующего вернуть долги Вооружённым силам."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fe4c9c52-08a9-420f-8c5b-91c79ff7412a",
                        "source_entry_id": "b2d591c0-0ab3-3503-8c59-4c4f3b4a7458",
                        "target_lang_word": "sedition",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sedition",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02b6126d-dca8-325d-bdc9-69ca04479fcf",
                                        "entry_id": "130609dc-4579-3d92-9d64-6ac4a4735ad1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Organized incitement of rebellion or civil disorder against authority or the state, usually by speech or writing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48cddacc-7438-40b6-b3a9-175ca3b29aab",
                                                "sense_id": "02b6126d-dca8-325d-bdc9-69ca04479fcf",
                                                "text": "That search may be made in the book of the records of thy fathers: so shalt thou find in the book of the records, and know that this city is a rebellious city, and hurtful unto kings and provinces, and that they have moved sedition within the same of old time: for which cause was this city destroyed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3eea6da-72c5-4be8-8e0f-8ecb3848a73b",
                                                "sense_id": "02b6126d-dca8-325d-bdc9-69ca04479fcf",
                                                "text": "But there are also strong objections to such a plan. It is not to be doubted, that a single man of prudence and good sense is better fitted, in delicate conjunctures, to balance the motives which may plead for and against the remission of the punishment, than any numerous body whatever. It deserves particular attention, that treason will often be connected with seditions which embrace a large proportion of the community; as lately happened in Massachusetts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf5c0ac8-473a-4c4c-99d1-1710e7c6d383",
                                                "sense_id": "02b6126d-dca8-325d-bdc9-69ca04479fcf",
                                                "text": "The prejudice against Indian settlers outside India is showing itself in a variety of ways: Under the impudent suggestion of sedition the Fiji Government has deported Mr. Manilal Doctor who with his brave and cultured wife has been rendering assistance to the poor indentured Indians of Fiji in a variety of ways."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54206211-07c7-38c7-b1b3-2b35355843bf",
                                        "entry_id": "130609dc-4579-3d92-9d64-6ac4a4735ad1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Insurrection or rebellion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
